@startuml 02c_state_ai_index
!include _style.iuml
title RishFlow – State Machine: AI Search Index

[*] --> NotIndexed

NotIndexed --> Indexing : start_index_for_ai(folder) [valid folder]
NotIndexed --> NotIndexed : start_index_for_ai [invalid folder] / return error

state Indexing {
  [*] --> CollectingFiles
  CollectingFiles : do / walk folder for text & PDF files
  CollectingFiles --> Extracting
  Extracting : do / parallel text extraction (4 workers)
  Extracting --> Extracting : file done [cache hit OR extracted] / done++
  Extracting --> [*] : [done == total]
}

Indexing --> Indexing : start_index_for_ai [same folder] / return "already_indexing"
Indexing --> Indexed : index complete / in_progress = false
Indexing --> IndexError : exception / return error

Indexed --> Querying : query_ai(folder, query)
Querying : do / substring search, build snippets
Querying --> Indexed : results returned
Indexed --> Indexing : folder content changed / re-index

IndexError --> NotIndexed : retry
@enduml
